! XRT-05 RT02(据付・変更しない)。バックボーン(L2 だけ・エリア 49.0002)。wide メトリック。
! IPv6 は単一トポロジ(IOS の既定)。サービス網 10.20.0.0/16 を IS-IS に載せている。
! ★M4-5 の仕込み= レベル 2 の認証(ハローは IF ごと・LSP/SNP はプロセスで)。鍵チェーン ISIS-L2・HMAC-MD5。
ipv6 unicast-routing
key chain ISIS-L2
 key 1
  key-string Bb0ne-2026
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.2 255.255.255.255
 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:255::2/128
 ip router isis
 ipv6 router isis
!
interface Loopback1
 description SERVICES-A
 ip address 10.20.0.1 255.255.0.0
 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:1020::1/64
 ip router isis
 ipv6 router isis
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description CORE-A to XR01
 ip address 10.0.12.2 255.255.255.0
 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:12::2/64
 ip router isis
 ipv6 router isis
 isis network point-to-point
 isis authentication mode md5 level-2
 isis authentication key-chain ISIS-L2 level-2
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description to RT03
 ip address 10.0.23.2 255.255.255.0
 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:23::2/64
 ip router isis
 ipv6 router isis
 isis network point-to-point
 isis authentication mode md5 level-2
 isis authentication key-chain ISIS-L2 level-2
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[2] }}
 description SVC-LAN
 ip address 10.0.100.2 255.255.255.0
 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:100::2/64
 ip router isis
 ipv6 router isis
 isis authentication mode md5 level-2
 isis authentication key-chain ISIS-L2 level-2
 no shutdown
!
router isis
 net 49.0002.0102.5500.0002.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 authentication mode md5 level-2
 authentication key-chain ISIS-L2 level-2
 log-adjacency-changes
!
